        "raw": "<p>Advanced Villains mode: Bugbear, the Operative, Greazer, Miss Information, and Ermine against the Prime Wardens (PW Fanatic, Haka, Tempest, AA, and CC).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Holy&nbsp;<em>cheese</em>&nbsp;that was a cluster of a thing&nbsp;I can't say on a family-friendly forum. Advanced Mode with these villains&nbsp;<em>really&nbsp;</em>hurts. Miss Info kicks down the damage output, Blood Scent is unkillable, Ermine keeps blowing up your setup, and Greazer is a beast with the damage (he'll contract for Haka), After multiple false starts i got a Fine with Tempest at 2 HP and everybody else incapacitated.</p>",
