      {
        "id": 227482,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-15T22:00:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The lack of available damage really hurts in this case. Something that works out well as an early play is to use Tempest's base power to play both copies of Reclaim from the Deep just for the card draw so you can start getting toward more useful stuff. If you can get Localized Hurricane and the Shackles out, the game gets a lot easier, especially once Miss Information drops. By then, you'll likely have multiple ways to pass Tempest powers and the battle can turn in your favor quickly.</p>\n<p>I also wouldn't suggest&nbsp;trying to save Haka - I didn't see&nbsp;any prayer of getting Greazer down before Haka dropped, so I just let it happen.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
