      {
        "id": 227485,
        "name": "Melkhor",
        "username": "Melkhor",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-15T22:51:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint by the skin of my teeth, with this one absolutely being the Tempest show! When the storm finally broke, Tempest was the only one left standing at 6 HP. Genebound Shackles and Hail Storm, where you should *always* pick the order of the damage to get as many damage boosts as possible ending up saving the day, but damn if this wasn't brutal and punishing.</p>\n<p>I let Haka drop first then took out Miss Information to get rid of her damage nerf. This, of course, boosted Bugbear to horribly dangerous levels, but Tempest just barely managed to take him down. Ermine was next and the Operative went down last (twice), but not before dropping Fanatic, Cosmic and the Adept, which made me *very* happy to have taken out Iaido Practitioner at the start of the game.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:41.929Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
