      {
        "id": 227486,
        "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-16T17:00:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near mint owies.<br>\nFirst game I made two big errors, one with not having enough destruction fodder for End of Days to make it to the environment turn and the other trying to nuke The Operative with Wrathful Retribution with Unhallowed Halls out &gt;.&lt; . Still brought down MI, Bugbear, and Greazer (through losing Haka), but couldn't keep enough stuff to put out enough damage to get Ermine and the Operative.<br>\n<br>\nSecond game was getting towards the same situation, but I did manage to wipe the original ongoings with End of Days first round. I don't know if the not discarding from Constant Prattle made it easier, but I managed to get Localized Hurricane and Clensing Downpour on Tempest and was feeding him powers every which way I could. With that, I took the team from everyone ~6hp with Haka down to everyone near 20. Kill order was Greazer (via Haka going down), MI to get rid of the damage reduction, BB because he hurts, Ermine to stop the destruction, and finally Operative due to that Aegis of Ressurection she gets.<br>\n<br>\n~Komori</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:42.004Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
