        "created_at": "2019-05-17T09:26:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Damn! Narrowly missed out on the mint! Hard slog had brought things down to Tempest vs Ermine - lots of extra power uses from Incaps had let him clear most everything else - then she played her redirection card twice and I was stuck looking for a Ball Lightning (Tempest was at 2hp so couldn’t take the redirect...)</p>\n<p>Game ended with everyone down apart from Ermine at 10...</p>",
